<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It will also auction Bondes at 364 and 728 days, it said.</p>
<p>CETES</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     800 million pesos  18.64 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     800 million pesos  19.75 pct</p>
<p>    181 days     800 million pesos  19.68 pct</p>
<p>    350 days     600 million pesos  18.80 pct</p>
<p>BONDES</p>
<p>    364 days     500 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>    728 days     700 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>((--Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559))</p>
</text>
